<h2>Asobi 1.0 (build 941)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Playing a voice note no longer loops the clip's audio under it</b> — or after it. The note's cue track moved the playhead the way a mouse drag does, which started the scrub loop; the note's voice is now the only sound, and the playhead still follows the cues.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
